@host = http://localhost:3000

### Login (guarda la cookie en el cliente REST que uses)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin" }

### Inventario de camaras
GET {{host}}/api/cameras

### Sesion de stream EZOPEN (409 = falta codigo de dispositivo)
POST {{host}}/api/cameras/mock-cam-01/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Sesion de stream con codigo de verificacion
POST {{host}}/api/cameras/mock-cam-01/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "ABCDEF" }

### Puertas
GET {{host}}/api/doors

### Comando de puerta (operator + reason; auditado)
POST {{host}}/api/doors/mock-door-01/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "unlock", "reason": "Visitante autorizado" }

### Marcaciones (48 h, paginado)
GET {{host}}/api/events?page=1&pageSize=20

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
